          %h3#ExplicitMentioningInPhysicsLiterature In the nuclear physics literature
          %p
            In the
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nuclear+physics"} nuclear physics
            = succeed "-literature" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/QCD"} QCD
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "confinement#OpenProblemConfinementReferences"} confinement problem
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nuclear+physics"} nuclear physics
